cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "IAC Benchmark: Imagined-future and Action Consistency"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "IAC Benchmark Authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RiseBun/IAC-iclr"
url: "https://github.com/RiseBun/IAC-iclr/tree/benchmark-release-v1"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-05"
abstract: >-
  IAC is a capability-stratified evaluation protocol for world action models.
  It measures whether a model's native action is consistent with the future
  visual state it imagines, using a frozen candidate-blind optical-flow probe
  and separate CFAC, CCFC, FAU and FCS evidence columns.
keywords:
  - world action model
  - foresight consistency
  - autonomous driving
  - benchmark
  - optical flow
